      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>If you have the Network Observability Operator installed, you can view network traffic metrics dashboards by selecting the <strong>Netobserv</strong> dashboard from the <strong>Dashboards</strong> drop-down list. For more information about metrics available in this <strong>Dashboard</strong>, see <a href="/observability/network_observability/metrics-alerts-dashboards#network-observability-viewing-dashboards_metrics-dashboards-alerts">Network Observability metrics dashboards</a>.</p></dd>
